## Key Concepts
- AVCaptureSession and VideoDataOutput
- Vision OCR and text observation handling
- Multithreading queues and memory budgeting
- PDFKit with metadata; privacy-by-default (no raw frames stored)
- Testing: latency, memory, OCR accuracy across lighting

## Code Example
